dd/1 error code=unsupported_op hint="This server version does not know that op."
dd/1 error code=unknown_ref refs=AB12,CD34 hint="Ref does not resolve at this rev; call outline."
dd/1 error code=ambiguous_ref refs=XAB123,YAB123 hint="Ref matches several blocks; use a listed candidate."
dd/1 error code=stale_base ref=7C02 current=a41c07 hint="The block changed after you read it; read it again."
dd/1 error code=match_count found=3 expected=2 refs=7C02 hint="Match count differs from expect; adjust find or expect."
dd/1 error code=no_match hint="The find text is not in the block."
dd/1 error code=no_change hint="The result equals the current text."
dd/1 error code=unsupported_structure hint="This operation is not available on this node type."
dd/1 error code=rich_block hint="The block holds inline objects this op would destroy."
dd/1 error code=redacted_block refs=7C02 hint="A data-loss rule withholds this block."
dd/1 error code=protected hint="The sheet is protected."
